   "title": "Greater Cost-Effectiveness, Greater Efficiency, Greater Sustainability",
   "lead": "<p>Sustainability plays a central role in ZOLLER’s corporate philosophy. As an innovative provider of precision measuring machines for presetting, measuring, and inspection of cutting tools, as well as software, interfaces, cloud services, and solutions for automating tooling processes, it is important to us not only to achieve economic success but also to take responsibility toward the environment and society.</p> <p>Integrating sustainable practices into our business processes is of critical importance to ZOLLER. We are aware that our activities have an effect on the environment, and therefore rely on resource-conserving technologies and energy-efficient production methods. By using environmentally friendly materials and optimizing our logistics processes, we actively contribute to reducing our environmental footprint. In addition, we foster a corporate culture that places sustainability at the midpoint. Our employees are trained and encouraged to make sustainable decisions and to contribute innovative ideas for improving our environmental performance.</p> <p>We believe that every individual can contribute to making our company fit for the future. ZOLLER is also committed to social responsibility. We support local communities and use our influence to advocate for fair working conditions. By upholding ethical standards throughout our supply chain, we ensure that our partner companies also operate sustainably. Overall, sustainability is not just a trend for ZOLLER, but a long-term goal. We are convinced that acting responsibly not only helps protect our environment but also strengthens our customers’ trust and enhances our competitiveness. Together with our partners and customers, we are working to shape a sustainable future—for our company and for future generations.</p>",
